      pieces.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: item.shadowweave-hood.name
    Values:
    - Shadowweave Hood
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: item.shadowweave-hood.description
    Values:
    - Pull it low and the dark forgets your face. One of four Shadowweave pieces.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: item.shadowweave-treads.name
    Values:
    - Shadowweave Treads
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: item.shadowweave-treads.description
    Values:
    - Soft enough that the floor keeps no count of you. One of four Shadowweave pieces.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
