  - Key: event.fallen-scout.title
    Values:
    - A Scout Who Stopped
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.fallen-scout.prompt
    Values:
    - You see the body of the scout, clenching a half-chewed pack.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.fallen-scout.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Go through the pack
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.fallen-scout.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - Coin, and something still worth carrying.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.fallen-scout.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - Whatever was chewing the pack has not finished.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.fallen-scout.option-2.label
    Values:
    - Leave it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.fallen-scout.option-2.decline
    Values:
    - You leave the scout to it.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
