  - Key: event.sealed-tomb-deep.title
    Values:
    - A Sealed Tomb
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.sealed-tomb-deep.prompt
    Values:
    - A slab of stone has been dragged over a hole and mortared down at the edges.
      Somebody wanted this shut.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.sealed-tomb-deep.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Lift the slab
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.sealed-tomb-deep.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - A single skeleton lies below, and it has no more use for what it holds.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.sealed-tomb-deep.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - The slab breaks, with your fingers underneath.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.choked-passage-galleries.title
    Values:
    - A Choked Passage
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.choked-passage-galleries.prompt
    Values:
    - Half the ceiling has come down across a side passage, you can see a room on
      the other end.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.choked-passage-galleries.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Shoulder the slab aside
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.choked-passage-galleries.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - The slab shifts, and a doorway opens.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.choked-passage-galleries.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - The ceiling comes down on the party.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.bone-choir.title
    Values:
    - The Bone Choir
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.bone-choir.prompt
    Values:
    - The skulls are humming, very low. There is a gap in the ring about the width
      of a person.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.bone-choir.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Stand in the ring
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.bone-choir.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - The humming rises, and the room is gone. Something answers.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.bone-choir.option-2.label
    Values:
    - Leave it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.bone-choir.option-2.decline
    Values:
    - You keep out of the ring.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.first-delver.title
    Values:
    - An Inanimate Statue
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.first-delver.prompt
    Values:
    - There is a statue with a sword in one of its hands, emitting an enchanting
      glow.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.first-delver.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Take the sword
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.first-delver.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - The stone fingers open.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.first-delver.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - The statue wakes.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.title
    Values:
    - The Knife Rack
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.prompt
    Values:
    - Every initiate took one. Every knife here is sharp, and the rack is wired to
      something overhead.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Lift a knife
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - It comes free without a sound.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - The wire pulls, and the rack answers.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.option-2.label
    Values:
    - Leave it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.knife-rack.option-2.decline
    Values:
    - You leave the knives where they are.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.title
    Values:
    - The Lich's Apprentice
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.prompt
    Values:
    - The apprentice's soul is still in here, begging in a very small voice to be
      let out or put to use.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Bind it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - The voice stops, and the box goes warm.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - It tears loose, and it is not small any more.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-2.label
    Values:
    - Free it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-2.success-1.text
    Values:
    - It thanks you, and leaves something behind.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-3.label
    Values:
    - Leave it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.lich-apprentice.option-3.decline
    Values:
    - You leave the box chained.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.red-basin.title
    Values:
    - A Basin of Red Water
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.red-basin.prompt
    Values:
    - It is warm. It is not quite water. Your wounds ache towards it.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.red-basin.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Drink
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.red-basin.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - It closes every wound, and leaves a taste that does not fade.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.red-basin.option-2.label
    Values:
    - Leave it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.red-basin.option-2.decline
    Values:
    - You leave the basin full.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.title
    Values:
    - The Thirteenth Step
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.prompt
    Values:
    - You have counted these stairs on every floor. There were always twelve.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.option-1.label
    Values:
    - Stand on it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.option-1.success-1.text
    Values:
    - Gold spills up out of the stone, far more than it could hold.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.option-1.failure-1.text
    Values:
    - Something from further down comes up.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.option-2.label
    Values:
    - Step around it
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
  - Key: event.thirteenth-step.option-2.decline
    Values:
    - You step around it, and do not count.
    Reviewed: 0
    Note: 
